abstract: >-
  Review of eleven devices and two software platforms, with six CSV resources
  from one participant. Raw sensor and questionnaire observations cover
  Session 1; supplied eye summaries cover three sessions. Analysis is
  descriptive, with missing acquisition, calibration and synchronization
  provenance. Code is MIT; original data observations and authored
  documentation are CC BY 4.0 where the author holds rights. Questionnaire
  wording, answer options and product media retain third-party rights;
  open instrument redistribution permission is unestablished. See NOTICE.md
  and DATA_ETHICS.md. Metadata alone establishes no deposited record or DOI.
